Subject: [PATCH] irqchip: ingenic: support per-CPU controllers and SoC variants
Upstream-Status: Pending

Add interrupt-controller variant matching, register access and interrupt
IDs for additional Ingenic SoCs, including X1600. Set up per-CPU irqchips
and cascaded interrupts for SMP systems while retaining a single-CPU path.

